+# Password Hashing Algorithm
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to hash passwords using **Argon2id**. This choice supersedes an earlier decision to use bcrypt: Argon2id was adopted for its stronger, memory-hard and time-hard resistance to GPU/ASIC brute-force attacks, providing better protection for stored password credentials under current threat conditions.
